<!-- Privacy Policy Page -->
<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="text-center mb-10">
    <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-bold rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider border border-emerald-200">
      Privacy & Data Protection
    </span>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mt-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Effective Date: November 20, 2026 • Last Updated: November 2026</p>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-6 sm:p-10 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
    
    <!-- Introduction -->
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">1</span>
        <span>Commitment to Your Privacy</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        At <strong>BookingApp</strong> ("we", "our", or "us"), we respect your privacy and are committed to safeguarding the personal information you share with us. This Privacy Policy outlines our practices regarding data collection, usage, storage, and your privacy rights across all our multi-tenant appointment booking services.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Data Collected -->
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">2</span>
        <span>Information We Collect</span>
      </h2>
      <p>We collect information strictly necessary to provide seamless appointment booking and merchant operations:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-2">
        <li><strong>Client & Appointment Data:</strong> Full name, email address, mobile phone number, appointment time, service requested, and specialist selected.</li>
        <li><strong>Business & Merchant Information:</strong> Salon/clinic name, operational hours, services catalog, business phone, address, and specialist roster.</li>
        <li><strong>Job Candidate Information:</strong> For users applying as staff, we collect full name, email, phone, applied position, years of experience, and optional cover notes.</li>
        <li><strong>Communications Data:</strong> Chat messages exchanged during general visitor inquiries or customer appointment consultations, along with timestamps and sender identifiers.</li>
        <li><strong>Technical & Telemetry Data:</strong> IP address, device browser type, and notification delivery audit logs (email/SMS transmission status).</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- How we use data -->
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">3</span>
        <span>How We Use Your Information</span>
      </h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 mt-2">
        <li>To reserve, schedule, and confirm appointments with verified service providers.</li>
        <li>To send automated appointment confirmation receipts, 24-hour and 1-hour reminders, and cancellation/reschedule alerts via Email and SMS.</li>
        <li>To power the unified <em>My Bookings</em> portal, allowing customers to track all appointments across multiple businesses without cumbersome password barriers.</li>
        <li>To deliver real-time in-app notification alerts to business owners and specialists regarding new bookings or customer inquiries.</li>
        <li>To evaluate staff recruitment candidate applications on behalf of prospective employers.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Payments & Security -->
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">4</span>
        <span>Payment Security & Non-Storage of Card Data</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        Payment processing on BookingApp is powered by <strong>Razorpay</strong>, an RBI-licensed payment aggregator certified under PCI-DSS Level 1:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 mt-2">
        <li>We <strong>never</strong> store your raw debit/credit card numbers, CVV codes, UPI PINs, or net banking passwords on our servers.</li>
        <li>We only receive and store transaction references (e.g. <code>razorpay_payment_id</code>), payment status, and captured amounts for receipt generation and refund reconciliation.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Multi-tenant Isolation -->
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">5</span>
        <span>Multi-Tenant Data Isolation</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        BookingApp is engineered with rigorous multi-tenant data partitioning. Each business operates within an isolated tenant boundary:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 mt-2">
        <li>Business owners can only access customer records, booking appointments, staff applications, and financial metrics tied to their own business identifier.</li>
        <li>Customers can review their full cross-tenant booking history securely via verified email authentication.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Data Retention & User Rights -->
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">6</span>
        <span>Your Data Rights & Choices</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        You have full authority over your personal information:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 mt-2">
        <li><strong>Right to Access & Portability:</strong> You can view all active and historical bookings through the <em>My Bookings</em> portal at any time.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Rectification:</strong> You may update your profile details, contact email, and telephone number from your account dashboard.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Deletion:</strong> You may request permanent deletion of your customer profile or applicant credentials by contacting our support desk.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Cookies and Third Party -->
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">7</span>
        <span>Cookies & Third-Party Service Providers</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        We use essential session cookies and local storage tokens solely to maintain authenticated sessions and remember visitor chat threads. We collaborate with trusted infrastructure partners:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 mt-2">
        <li><strong>Nodemailer / SMTP:</strong> For automated email confirmations and reminders.</li>
        <li><strong>Twilio:</strong> For critical SMS appointment notifications.</li>
        <li><strong>Razorpay:</strong> For secure payment gateway processing.</li>
        <li><strong>Google OAuth:</strong> For optional 1-click single sign-on authentication.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Contact -->
    <div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Privacy Questions & Grievance Officer</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-xs">
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or wish to exercise your data rights, contact our Data Protection Officer at:
        <br>
        <strong class="text-gray-900">Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:privacy@bookingapp.local" class="text-primary-600 font-semibold hover:underline">privacy@bookingapp.local</a>
        <br>
        <strong class="text-gray-900">Office:</strong> BookingApp Technologies, Civil Lines, Prayagraj, UP, India.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
